# Anthropic Claude (direct) — MT-248 launch-gate story-text provider.
# Activated only when STORY_GEN_PROVIDER=claude; the generator lazy-imports
# this so the app still boots if it's absent. Hand-pinned into requirements.txt
# (anthropic + jiter + docstring-parser, with hashes) rather than via a full
# pip-compile, to avoid the Python-3.13 audioop-lts lockfile landmine; the other
# transitive deps (anyio/distro/httpx/pydantic/sniffio/typing-extensions) were
# already pinned and satisfy anthropic's constraints.
anthropic>=0.120.0

# OpenAI (direct) — MT-248 launch-gate story-text provider for the free/volume
# tier (GPT-5 mini). Activated only when STORY_GEN_PROVIDER=openai or =tiered;
# the generator lazy-imports this so the app still boots if it's absent.
# Hand-pinned into requirements.txt (openai==2.41.1 + tqdm, with hashes) rather
# than via a full pip-compile, to avoid the Python-3.13 audioop-lts lockfile
# landmine; openai's other transitive deps (anyio/distro/httpx/jiter/pydantic/
# sniffio/typing-extensions) were already pinned and satisfy its constraints.
