# Azure AI Speech — MT-248 launch-gate: the LICENSED replacement narration
# provider (same neural voices as Edge, real-time = no retention, commercially
# licensed for a kids' app). Activated only when AZURE_SPEECH_KEY +
# AZURE_SPEECH_REGION are set; azure_tts_service lazy-imports it so the app boots
# without it. Hand-pinned into requirements.txt (azure-cognitiveservices-speech
# ==1.50.0 — the Linux x86_64 manylinux wheel — plus its one transitive dep
# azure-core==1.41.0; requests/typing-extensions were already pinned) rather than
# a full pip-compile, to avoid the Python-version lockfile landmine.
