# Python 3.13 Compatibility
# 3.13 removed the stdlib `audioop` module (used by pydub); audioop-lts backports
# it. It Requires-Python >=3.13, so gate it — on <=3.12 the stdlib module is used
# and this dist has no installable distribution (would break the 3.11 CI install).
audioop-lts ; python_version >= "3.13"
